SUMMARY:East Pete Day Carnival
DESCRIPTION:Pre-Order your Carnival All-You-Can-Ride Wristband\nFor the first time ever we are offering an early-bird discount at $30 (originally $35) on wristbands. Each Wristband purchased is good for any ONE day of the carnival. They can be purchased online using the button below. \nEast Petersburg Day events kick off on Tuesday\, September 15th\, with our community carnival thru Sat 19th. On Saturday morning the East Petersburg Day 5K and Kids Fun Run will start the festivities and celebration of our community. \nThe annual East Petersburg Day Parade will follow the 5K at 10 am and lead families\, friends and neighbors to East Petersburg Community Park for an amazing day filled with live music\, jugglers\, rides\, games\, and food! \nAnd when you visit the park for a fun filled afternoon\, be sure to grab your Golf Ball Drop tickets over at our Tent or purchase them online here. \nDaily Timeline of East Pete Days​\n️Wednesday\n– 6 pm to close Rides are open\n– 5:30 to 8:30 pm Live Music from Vinyl Ventures \n​Thursday\n– 5:30 pm to close Rides are open– 6:00 to 8:00 pm Live Music by Big Jazz Band​ \n​Friday\n– 5:30 pm Singing of National Anthem\n– 5:30 pm to close Rides are open\n– 6:30pm – Whoopie Pie Contest\n– 6:30pm to 8pm Live Music by TBD \n​Saturday\n– 8:30am – Kids Fun Run\n– 9:00am – 5K\n– 10:00am – Parade– 4:00 pm to close Rides are open\n– 6:30pm to 9:30pm Live Music by Pop Scotch\n– 9:45pm – Fireworks \n​This amazing week will come to a close Saturday night around 9:30pm with an amazing display of fireworks!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/east-pete-day-carnival/
LOCATION:East Petersburg Community Park\, 6051 Pine Street\, East Petersburg\, PA\, 17520\, United States
