SUMMARY:Solanco Fair
DESCRIPTION:The Solanco Fair\, a beloved tradition in southern Lancaster County\, captures the “wholesome atmosphere” envisioned by its founders in 1950. Born from the initiative of local farm women and agricultural groups\, the fair remains a steadfast celebration of rural life and community fellowship. \nHeld annually in Quarryville\, the event is renowned for its parade\, iron-lung-defying food like pit poultry\, and high-quality livestock exhibits. Visitors can browse diverse competitive displays featuring needlework\, baking\, and homegrown produce. This three-day September gathering stays true to its roots\, offering a family-friendly environment where agricultural heritage and friendly competition take center stage. \n\n\nSee our schedule of Fairs & Festivals in Lancaster County and surrounding areas.\nOther Things To Do in Lancaster\, PA\n\n\nArt Galleries\nDistilleries\nEscape Rooms\nFactory Tours\n\n\n\nIndoor Things To Do\nMassage and Spas\nOutdoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nShooting Ranges\nTheaters\nWineries\nAll Things To Do in Lancaster
