SUMMARY:Amish Fall Farmhouse Experience at Old Windmill Farm
DESCRIPTION:An autumn afternoon in our farm kitchen. Join us as we bake bread\, churn butter from our own cows’ cream\, and press apple cider with a traditional hand-cranked apple press. Then sit down and enjoy all three together\, with the freshly churned butter on the bread warm from the oven. \n\n\n\nPress fresh cider with a traditional press\nChurn butter from our own cows’ cream\nEnjoy freshly baked bread\nDrink cider and eat bread with fresh butter\nA working farm kitchen\, not a demonstration\nAdvance reservations required\n\n\n\nPart of the visit is outdoors – dress for the weather. \nBook This Tour
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/amish-fall-farmhouse-experience-old-windmill-farm/2026-09-17/
LOCATION:Old Windmill Farm\, 262 Paradise Lane\, Ronks\, PA\, 17572\, United States
CATEGORIES:Amish,Autumn,Children & Family Events,Classes,Food & Beverage Events,Fun on the Farm,Outdoor Activities,Strasburg, PA,Tour
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/old-windmill-farm-event-amish-fall-experience.webp
