SUMMARY:Mark Huber Playing Grand Piano at Thorn Hill Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Join Us on Thursday\, September 17th at the Thorn Hill Lancaster\, PA Tasting Room with local musician Mark Huber playing his grand piano! \nOur Tasting Room is staying open later for him to play 6 pm to 9 pm. \nThis event is open to the public\, you can bring in your own food. Enjoy a glass of Thorn Hill Vineyards wine while listening to Live Music. No cover charge. You can stop over any time from 6pm to 9pm to hear him play! \n\nOther Things To Do in Lancaster\, PA for Adults\n\n\nArt Galleries\nDistilleries\nEscape Rooms\nBreweries\n\n\n\nFactory Tours\nIndoor Things To Do\nMassage and Spas\nOutdoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nShooting Ranges\nTheaters\nWineries\nAll Things To Do in Lancaster
